      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- rule database - store rules define by the service owner\n- rules retriever - this is background process that parodically checks for any modification to the rules in the database. the rule cache is updated if there\n   is any change in database\n- throttle rules cache - it consists of rules retrieved from the rule database. \n- decision - maker this component is responsible for making decisions against the rules in the cache.\n- client identifier builder - it generate ui for client request \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- rule database - store rules define by the service owner\n- rules retriever - this is background process that parodically checks for any modification to the rules in the database. the rule cache is updated if there\n   is any change in database\n- throttle rules cache - it consists of rules retrieved from the rule database. \n- decision - maker this component is responsible for making decisions against the rules in the cache.\n- client identifier builder - it generate ui for client request \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Zv1IMVv34UdDaXmAf7VDB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 281,
      "y": 2501,
      "width": 1333.8592529296875,
      "height": 1225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1L",
