      "seed": 1018674921,
      "version": 1060,
      "versionNonce": 566877993,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789638296552,
      "created": 1789637048849,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Ad Click Aggregator \n\nAn Ad click aggregator is a system that collects and aggregates data \non add clicks. it is used by advertisers to track the performance of their add and optimze their \ncampaigns for our purpose we will assume these are ads displayed on a website or app like facebook\n\n\n\nFunctional Requirements \n\n- user click on ad and get redirected to the advertiser's website\n- advertisers can query click metrics over time w/1 minute granularity \n\n10M ads at any given time \n10k ad clicks per second at peak \n\n\nNon functional \n\n- Salable to support peak 10k CPS\n- low latency analytics queries < 1s\n- fault tolerance \n- Data integrity \n- As real time as possible \n- idempotent of ad clicks  \n\n\nInput:\n- click data\n- advertiser queries\n\noutputs:\n- Redirects\n- aggregated click matrics\n\nData flow\n\n- click data comes into the system \n- user is redirected\n- click data validted\n- click data logged\n- click data aggregated\n- aggregated data queried \n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ad Click Aggregator \n\nAn Ad click aggregator is a system that collects and aggregates data \non add clicks. it is used by advertisers to track the performance of their add and optimze their \ncampaigns for our purpose we will assume these are ads displayed on a website or app like facebook\n\n\n\nFunctional Requirements \n\n- user click on ad and get redirected to the advertiser's website\n- advertisers can query click metrics over time w/1 minute granularity \n\n10M ads at any given time \n10k ad clicks per second at peak \n\n\nNon functional \n\n- Salable to support peak 10k CPS\n- low latency analytics queries < 1s\n- fault tolerance \n- Data integrity \n- As real time as possible \n- idempotent of ad clicks  \n\n\nInput:\n- click data\n- advertiser queries\n\noutputs:\n- Redirects\n- aggregated click matrics\n\nData flow\n\n- click data comes into the system \n- user is redirected\n- click data validted\n- click data logged\n- click data aggregated\n- aggregated data queried \n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
